      {
        "@language": "fr-ca",
        "@value": "Le 5 septembre 2027 à 0 h, à Lieu à préciser – Terrebonne (Terrebonne). The event is returning to Île-des-Moulins again this year. Take a trip back in time and discover a host of historical activities for the whole family! For more information, click HERE."
