    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "fr-ca",
        "@value": "Le 27 décembre 2026 à 15 h, à Théâtre Marcellin-Champagnat (Laval). Fans of Monty Python, Mr. Bean, and Dr. Seuss… Grab your teacups! Combining British propriety with an unabashed love for the unexpected, London’s 3-time Impresario Award-winning duo James & Jamesy steep an outrageously funny and…"
