    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "ALICE in WONDERLAND"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "Alice in Wonderland was written Tom Whalley and is directed by Katie McHugh and Jean-Frédéric Samson. Alice in Wonderland is the perfect holiday event for patrons of all ages. With singing, dancing, silly jokes, goodies and baddies, the Hudson Village Theatre Panto is loads of fun for everyone! For over 20 years, we have been delighting children and adults with what has become an annual tradition and fundraiser for theatre. The show runs throughout the holidays from December 11 to January 3 (matinées and evenings). For information on Alice in Wonderland, click here."
      }
    ],
