        "@value": "Le 30 octobre 2026 à 18 h, à Lieu à préciser (Montréal) (Montréal). Save the date! All are invited to our Annual Pumpkin Ball on Friday, October 30th beginning at 6:00 p.m. in Kildonan Hall. Wear a costume and join us for a delicious dinner, games and entertainment. Reservations are a must –…"
