        "@value": "Save the date! All are invited to our Annual Pumpkin Ball on Friday, October 30th beginning at 6:00 p.m. in Kildonan Hall. Wear a costume and join us for a delicious dinner, games and entertainment. Reservations are a must – contact Sharon at [email] or phone or text [phone]."
