        "@value": "Le 7 novembre 2026 à 14 h, à Hudson Creative Hub (Hudson). Our Songwriters Spotlight concert series, hosted by Briana Doyle and Seiji Gutierrez, celebrates the depth, diversity, and heart of our local songwriting community. Inspired by the classic Nashville-style song circle, this intimate concert…"
