        "@value": "Bugs Bunny at the Symphony — Montréal | VOIR"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "fr-ca",
        "@value": "Le 12 février 2027 à 0 h, à Salle Wilfrid-Pelletier (Montréal). Looking ahead, Warner Bros. Discovery presents the ciné-concert Bugs Bunny at the Symphony at Salle Wilfrid-Pelletier at Place des Arts on February 12 and 13, 2027, in time to celebrate Bugs Bunny’s 85th birthday, and the concert’s…"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#url": [
      {
        "@language": "fr-ca",
