        "@value": "For the first time, as a prelude to FASS, Dance Trails will also take place in Sainte-Adèle! Stroll through the Claude-Henri Grignon Park where short dance and music performances await you. Enjoy nature and dance! Limited seating, reservations required Three departures per day: 2 p.m., 3 p.m. and 4 p.m. Approximate duration: 60 minutes *Please note you will be standing for the duration of the activity."
